<title>SPAIN: Spain's Petronor says strike called Mar 21-27.</title>
<headline>Spain's Petronor says strike called Mar 21-27.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at two Petronor refineries and one fluid catalytic cracker plant in Bilbao Spain are to strike from 1600 GMT on Friday March 21 to 0500 GMT on Friday March 27, a spokesman for Petronor said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The output of the refineries was around 180,000-190,000 bpd, the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
